-- The residues coprime to n as a list, Euler's totient as its length, the
-- list scaled by a coprime factor, and what scaling does to products and to
-- multiplicities: it permutes the units
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
